  "releaseNotes": "Improves typed decode coverage and fast-path performance for DTO-heavy payloads.\n- Adds typed decode support for positional records and constructor-bound classes without parameterless constructors\n- Fixes typed decode for array targets and collection interfaces such as IList<T>, IReadOnlyList<T>, and IEnumerable<T>\n- Fixes typed decode for string-keyed dictionary targets, dictionary properties, and object-valued dictionary rows\n- Improves decode performance by keeping supported record, collection, and dictionary shapes on the direct materializer path",
